.TH ACTION_BIND_AXIS 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
action_bind_axis \- Bind action a to a gamepad axis with a sign, so a stick direction counts as the action past a dead zone
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqactions.h\(dq
.BI "void action_bind_axis(ActionMap *m, int a, PadAxis ax, float sign);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Bind action a to a gamepad axis with a sign, so a stick direction counts as the action past a dead zone. sign +1 for positive travel (right, down, trigger pulled), \-1 for negative (left, up). action_down treats the axis as held beyond 0.5; action_axis returns its analog value.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH MODULE
input (src/engine/input/actions.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR action_axis (3),
.BR action_down (3),
.BR PadAxis (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
